{TEXT("18 磅榴霰弹齐射"),TEXT("18-pdr shrapnel salvo")},
{TEXT("7.7 cm 榴霰弹齐射"),TEXT("7.7 cm shrapnel salvo")},
{TEXT("引信装定操练"),TEXT("Fuze-setting drill")},
{TEXT("榴霰弹引信"),TEXT("Timed shrapnel")},
{TEXT("炮手转动引信刻度，弹丸在敌军头顶炸开。熟练的炮组多送来一轮三发榴霰弹；开阔地上的密集步兵最危险，深壕和坚土仍能挡住弹珠。"),TEXT("The fuze scale turns; the shell bursts above the line. Practised crews add a third three-shell salvo. Crowded infantry in the open are most exposed; deep trenches and earth still screen the balls.")},
