{TEXT("\n配属已满，先取消一支分队的配属。"),TEXT("\nAll places are assigned. Remove a detachment first.")},
{TEXT("炮兵与航空配属"),TEXT("Artillery and Air Attachments")},
{TEXT("\n配属已满，先取消一项支援的配属。"),TEXT("\nAll places are assigned. Remove a support mission first.")},
{TEXT("至少保留步枪班，其余步兵和支援可按本次行动需要选择。"),TEXT("Keep a rifle section assigned and choose the remaining infantry and support to suit this operation.")},
{TEXT("至少保留步枪班，其余步兵和支援可按本次行动需要选择。"),TEXT("Keep a rifle section assigned and choose the remaining infantry and support to suit this operation."),TEXT("道路和联络线只能容纳有限的配属。步枪班留在序列中，其余兵力与支援按这次行动的需要取舍。")},
{TEXT("至少保留步枪班，其余步兵和支援可按本次行动需要选择。"),TEXT("Keep a rifle section assigned and choose the remaining infantry and support to suit this operation."),TEXT("Roads and communication lines can support only so many attachments. The rifle section remains on the roster; choose the other troops and support to suit this operation.")},
