{TEXT("返回地图"),TEXT("Return to the map"),TEXT("返回命令图")},
{TEXT("返回地图"),TEXT("Return to the map"),TEXT("Return to the Map")},
{TEXT("确认配属"),TEXT("Confirm attachments")},
{TEXT("确认配属"),TEXT("Confirm attachments"),TEXT("签发出战序列")},
{TEXT("确认配属"),TEXT("Confirm attachments"),TEXT("Issue the Marching Order")},
{TEXT("去而复返"),TEXT("Returned to the Front")},
{TEXT("深渊回忆"),TEXT("Memories of the Abyss")},
{TEXT("士兵之悔"),TEXT("Soldier's Regret")},
{TEXT("敌军保留预备队，记住暴露枪位，并配合炮火推进。敌我使用相同的武器与伤亡规则。"),TEXT("The enemy keeps reserves, remembers exposed guns and coordinates its advance with artillery. Both sides use the same weapon and casualty rules."),TEXT("敌军善于保留预备队、记住暴露的枪位，并让炮火与步兵互相掩护。每一次停留与出壕都需要判断；敌我仍遵守相同的命中、遮蔽和伤亡规则。")},
{TEXT("敌军更快组织下一梯队，按观察到的火力与兵力选择炮击地段。烟幕与机枪交替掩护，给孤立部队留下的喘息更少。"),TEXT("The enemy organises follow-up waves sooner and selects fire missions from observed troops and weapons. Smoke and machineguns provide alternating cover, leaving isolated units less time to recover.")},
{TEXT("敌军传令较慢，两次进攻之间有更多整队时间。适合熟悉战壕与支援。"),TEXT("Enemy orders travel more slowly, leaving more time to regroup between attacks. A gentler introduction to trenches and support."),TEXT("接近原有战役节奏。敌军传令较慢，进攻之间留有整队的间隙，适合熟悉战壕、火力与增援时机。")},
