{TEXT("关闭"),TEXT("Off")},
{TEXT("当前 %.0f nit，是游戏最亮高光的显示目标。1 nit = 1 cd/m²。\n\n保持平时的屏幕亮度和局部调光设置，以显示器或系统 HDR 校准的峰值起步。左侧亮块的十字比背景暗 10%%；逐步调到十字刚好消失。若始终可见，屏幕可能在映射亮部，请沿用已校准的峰值，不必一直推高。\n\n200–4000 nit；每次调整 50 nit。"),TEXT("Currently %.0f nits: the target for the brightest highlights. 1 nit = 1 cd/m².\n\nKeep your usual display brightness and local dimming. Start with the peak established by your display or Windows HDR calibration. The cross in the bright patch is 10%% darker than its background; adjust until it just disappears. If it stays visible, your display may be tone-mapping highlights. Keep the calibrated peak instead of raising it indefinitely.\n\n200–4000 nits; 50-nit steps.")},
{TEXT("当前 %.0f nit，决定普通白色和漫反射物体的亮度基准，不是火光的最高亮度。%s\n\n默认跟随当前屏幕的 Windows 白亮度，无法读取时使用 203 nit。峰值亮度不能代替纸白。手动调整后会为这块屏幕保留，恢复推荐值可再次跟随系统。\n\n白色应自然舒适，块内十字应能分辨，不要以让它消失为目标。80–1000 nit，最高为屏幕峰值的 80%%；每次调整 10 nit。"),TEXT("Currently %.0f nits: the reference brightness for ordinary white and diffuse surfaces, not the peak of flames. %s\n\nAutomatic mode follows this display's Windows white level, using 203 nits when unavailable. Peak brightness cannot replace paper white. Manual values are remembered for each display; restore recommendations to follow Windows again.\n\nWhite should look natural and comfortable, with the cross still distinguishable. Do not try to make it disappear. 80–1000 nits, limited to 80%% of display peak; 10-nit steps.")},
{TEXT("目前自动跟随系统。"),TEXT("Currently following Windows automatically.")},
{TEXT("目前使用手动校准。"),TEXT("Currently using manual calibration.")},
{TEXT("当前 %.0f nit，单独控制文字、照片和操作台的亮度；不改变战场曝光或高光峰值。%s\n\n默认跟随当前屏幕的 Windows 白亮度，读取失败时使用 203 nit。先把画面纸白调舒服，再看本页文字与战场操作台。降低刺眼的字和亮边，提高到文字清楚即可。\n\n每块屏幕独立保留手动值。80–1000 nit，最高为屏幕峰值的 80%%；每次调整 10 nit。"),TEXT("Currently %.0f nits: the separate brightness of text, photographs and the console. It does not change battlefield exposure or peak highlights. %s\n\nAutomatic mode follows this display's Windows white level, using 203 nits when unavailable. Set comfortable paper white first, then judge the text here and the battlefield console. Reduce glare while keeping the lettering clear.\n\nManual values are saved per display. 80–1000 nits, limited to 80%% of display peak; 10-nit steps.")},
{TEXT("右侧参照块为 %.4f nit，十字为 %.4f nit。它只用来观察屏幕的近黑层次，不改变战场曝光或黑位。\n\n从接近纯黑开始，看十字是否仍能辨认。若暗部被室内反光盖住，先调整环境；不要用这个参照去抬亮整幅游戏。\n\n0.0001–0.1 nit；每次减半或加倍。"),TEXT("The reference patch is %.4f nits; its cross is %.4f nits. This only reveals near-black detail and does not alter battlefield exposure or black level.\n\nStart near black and check whether the cross remains distinguishable. If room reflections obscure it, adjust the viewing environment first. Do not use this reference to brighten the whole game.\n\n0.0001–0.1 nits; each step halves or doubles the value.")},
