{TEXT("突破敌方后沿，或击溃守军士气"),TEXT("Break through the enemy rear line or break the defenders' morale")},
{TEXT("斯卡尔普河的晨雾"),TEXT("Morning mist on the Scarpe")},
{TEXT("法国 · 阿拉斯东郊"),TEXT("France · East of Arras")},
{TEXT("阿拉斯攻势开始。英军从准备已久的地道与集结地出击，为法军在埃纳河的攻势牵制德军；最初的突破之后，纵深守军正重新组织。"),TEXT("The Arras offensive begins. British troops emerge from long-prepared tunnels and assembly areas to draw German strength from the coming French attack on the Aisne. Beyond the first breach, defenders in depth are reorganising.")},
{TEXT("你的连队负责巩固前进通路。步枪班先占交通壕，留一队从壕肩掩护轮换；其他专门分队尚未赶到，不要把所有人一次送进开阔地。"),TEXT("Your company must secure the approach. Rifle sections occupy communication trenches, leaving one section on the parapet to cover reliefs. Specialist detachments have not yet arrived. Do not send everyone into the open at once.")},
{TEXT("低云压住观察距离。湿滑壕外地面拖慢推进，壕内交通保持通畅。"),TEXT("Low cloud restricts observation. Wet ground slows movement outside the trenches; communication within them remains clear.")},
{TEXT("梅西讷的破晓"),TEXT("Dawn at Messines")},
{TEXT("比利时 · 梅西讷山脊"),TEXT("Belgium · Messines Ridge")},
{TEXT("地下爆破撕开梅西讷山脊的德军阵地。英军第二集团军需要把突入的部队变成稳固的防线，为后续佛兰德攻势取得观察高地。"),TEXT("Underground mines tear open the German positions on Messines Ridge. British Second Army must turn penetration into a secure line, winning observation heights for the coming Flanders offensive.")},
{TEXT("主攻部队已经越过前沿，本连负责守住观察壕。新配属的投弹队借烟幕接近，步枪班随后进壕巩固，分批完成攻击与接替。"),TEXT("The main assault has passed the front line. Your company must secure the observation trench. Newly attached bombers approach under smoke, followed by rifle sections to consolidate. Stagger the assault and relief through the exits.")},
{TEXT("主攻部队已经越过前沿，本连负责守住观察壕。新配属的投弹队借烟幕接近，步枪班随后进壕巩固，分批完成攻击与接替。"),TEXT("The main assault has passed the front line. Your company must secure the observation trench. Newly attached bombers approach under smoke, followed by rifle sections to consolidate. Stagger the assault and relief through the exits."),TEXT("主攻已经越过前沿，留下来的任务是守住观察壕。新配属的投弹队借烟幕接近壕口，步枪班进壕巩固；进攻与接替不要挤在同一个出口。")},
{TEXT("主攻部队已经越过前沿，本连负责守住观察壕。新配属的投弹队借烟幕接近，步枪班随后进壕巩固，分批完成攻击与接替。"),TEXT("The main assault has passed the front line. Your company must secure the observation trench. Newly attached bombers approach under smoke, followed by rifle sections to consolidate. Stagger the assault and relief through the exits."),TEXT("The main assault has passed the front line. Your task is to secure the observation trench. Newly attached bombers close under smoke while rifles consolidate. Assault and relief must not crowd the same exit.")},
{TEXT("破碎坡面与坑岸提供分段遮蔽。短阵雨会加深泥色，但观察条件较好。"),TEXT("Broken slopes and crater lips provide cover in stages. Brief showers darken the mud, but observation remains comparatively good.")},
{TEXT("雨中的皮尔克姆"),TEXT("Rain over Pilckem")},
{TEXT("比利时 · 伊普尔突出部"),TEXT("Belgium · Ypres Salient")},
{TEXT("第三次伊普尔战役开幕，目标是突出部东北的高地与交通线。排水系统已被炮火破坏，随后降雨让进攻通路逐渐变成积水的弹坑带。"),TEXT("Third Ypres opens against the heights and communications northeast of the salient. Shellfire has destroyed the drainage system. Rain will turn the approaches into waterlogged belts of craters.")},
{TEXT("刘易斯组已经赶到，用它压住远处枪口，投弹班等炮火压下后再接近。每占一壕就留下守军；漫长的开阔地不适合整齐齐射式的总冲锋。"),TEXT("The Lewis section has arrived. Use it to pin distant gun positions while bombers wait for the barrage to suppress the defenders. Garrison each captured trench. A long stretch of open ground is no place for a single massed charge.")},
{TEXT("连绵雨水，深泥与积水坑。壕外速度明显下降，烟幕与雨幕共同限制长射界。"),TEXT("Persistent rain, deep mud and flooded craters. Movement outside trenches slows sharply, while smoke and rain restrict long fields of fire.")},
{TEXT("康布雷的缺口"),TEXT("The breach at Cambrai")},
{TEXT("法国 · 康布雷西南"),TEXT("France · Southwest of Cambrai")},
{TEXT("康布雷攻势用集中坦克与校射准备较少的突然炮击打开兴登堡防线。邻段装甲的突破正在扩大，步兵必须控制交通壕，防止德军切断两翼。"),TEXT("Massed tanks and a surprise barrage with little preliminary registration breach the Hindenburg Line. Armour in the neighbouring sector widens the gap. Infantry must secure communication trenches before German counterattacks sever the flanks.")},
{TEXT("本连负责缺口侧翼的步兵地段。连续夺壕后保留机枪守住出口；炮火打散远处集结，预备队留待敌军反扑。"),TEXT("Your company holds the infantry sector beside the breach. Leave machine guns covering the exits as you capture successive trenches. Artillery breaks up distant assemblies; keep reserves for the counterattack.")},
{TEXT("较坚实的地面利于快速转移。长射界使裸露机枪危险，也给镜瞄射手留下机会。"),TEXT("Firmer ground permits quick moves. Long sightlines expose machine guns and give telescopic riflemen their chance.")},
{TEXT("雾里的后卫"),TEXT("Rearguard in the mist")},
{TEXT("法国 · 圣康坦以西"),TEXT("France · West of Saint-Quentin")},
{TEXT("德军“米夏埃尔”攻势在浓雾和急促炮击中展开。突击部队穿过薄弱处，英军前沿联络不断中断；后卫需要争取时间，让纵深部队重新成线。"),TEXT("Operation Michael opens beneath dense fog and a violent barrage. Assault troops pass through weak points as British front-line communications fail. The rearguard must buy time for the troops behind it to form a new line.")},
{TEXT("守住中央交通壕，为后撤部队争取时间。敌方突击组可能穿过烟雾接近，观察员和机枪组需要步兵保护。"),TEXT("Hold the central communication trench to give withdrawing troops time. Enemy assault sections may approach through the mist; infantry must protect the observers and machine-gun crews.")},
{TEXT("守住中央交通壕，为后撤部队争取时间。敌方突击组可能穿过烟雾接近，观察员和机枪组需要步兵保护。"),TEXT("Hold the central communication trench to give withdrawing troops time. Enemy assault sections may approach through the mist; infantry must protect the observers and machine-gun crews."),TEXT("守住中央交通壕，为后撤部队争取时间。提防穿过烟雾的自动武器突击组；让观察员活着，机枪弹药手准备接替暴露的枪位。")},
{TEXT("守住中央交通壕，为后撤部队争取时间。敌方突击组可能穿过烟雾接近，观察员和机枪组需要步兵保护。"),TEXT("Hold the central communication trench to give withdrawing troops time. Enemy assault sections may approach through the mist; infantry must protect the observers and machine-gun crews."),TEXT("Secure the central communication trench for the withdrawing troops. Watch for automatic-weapon sections emerging through the mist. Keep observers alive and ammunition bearers ready to take over exposed gun positions.")},
{TEXT("晨雾显著压缩射程，湿地拖慢壕外转移。近战威胁会在能看清人影之前逼近。"),TEXT("Morning fog sharply reduces effective range. Wet ground slows movement outside trenches. Close assault may arrive before a figure can be clearly identified.")},
{TEXT("亚眠：雾后向前"),TEXT("Amiens: beyond the mist")},
{TEXT("法国 · 亚眠东部"),TEXT("France · East of Amiens")},
{TEXT("亚眠攻势以突然袭击和诸兵种协同开场，英帝国与法军向德军阵地推进，百日攻势由此展开。主攻队伍仍需要步兵夺壕、巩固和抵挡局部反击。"),TEXT("The Amiens offensive opens with surprise and combined arms. British Empire and French troops advance into the German positions, beginning the Hundred Days. The main assault still needs infantry to capture trenches, consolidate and defeat local counterattacks.")},
{TEXT("本连沿主攻侧翼推进。狙击组掩护机枪跃进，军士带投弹班穿过最后的交通壕；在雾中保持预备队，别让反击切断已经取得的进展。"),TEXT("Your company advances along the assault flank. Snipers cover machine guns moving forward, while NCOs lead bombers through the last communication trenches. Retain a reserve in the fog so a counterattack cannot cut off your gains.")},
{TEXT("湿润农田与破碎阵地交错。较轻泥泞允许轮换推进，晨雾仍削弱远距离观察。"),TEXT("Damp farmland alternates with shattered positions. Lighter mud permits movement in bounds, but morning mist still hampers distant observation.")},
{TEXT("阿拉斯：守住支点"),TEXT("Arras: hold the strongpoint")},
{TEXT("英军阿拉斯攻势突然压向前沿。第一线遭到猛烈冲击，守军必须依靠纵深支点和局部反击，阻止最初的突破变成持续推进。"),TEXT("The British Arras offensive strikes the forward line. The first positions come under heavy pressure. Defenders must rely on strongpoints in depth and local counterattacks to keep the first breach from becoming a sustained advance.")},
{TEXT("守住中央观察壕。步枪班阻止英军抢占空壕，投弹队留待近处反击；机枪组尚未归建，炮火要留给后续集结，不要浪费在零散侦察兵身上。"),TEXT("Secure the central observation trench. Rifle sections must deny empty trenches to the British; keep bombers for a close counterattack. The machine guns have not returned to the company. Save artillery for following concentrations, not scattered scouts.")},
{TEXT("低云与湿泥收窄观察。后方步兵可通过满员友壕接近前沿，不必等守军让位。"),TEXT("Low cloud and wet mud narrow observation. Following infantry can pass through full friendly trenches toward the front without waiting for the garrison to move.")},
{TEXT("山脊失守之后"),TEXT("After the ridge falls")},
{TEXT("比利时 · 梅西讷东坡"),TEXT("Belgium · Eastern slopes of Messines")},
{TEXT("梅西讷山脊的阵地被地下爆破和随后的进攻撕开。英军正试图在高地上站稳，残存守军向东坡支点收拢，准备有限的反击。"),TEXT("Mines and the assault that followed have torn apart the positions on Messines Ridge. The British are trying to establish themselves on the heights. Surviving defenders gather at strongpoints on the eastern slope for a limited counterattack.")},
{TEXT("先以机枪稳住后沿，再让投弹班靠近前方观察壕。烟幕遮住被英军看穿的交通壕，避免从同一出口连续冒头。"),TEXT("Steady the rear line with machine guns before bombers approach the forward observation trench. Smoke can conceal communication trenches overlooked by the British. Do not keep emerging through the same exit.")},
{TEXT("坑岸和壕肩打断火线。可利用局部遮蔽接近，坡面上的孤立小队容易被压住。"),TEXT("Crater lips and parapets interrupt the line of fire. Approach through patches of cover; isolated sections on the slope are easily pinned.")},
{TEXT("佛兰德的泥线"),TEXT("The mud line in Flanders")},
{TEXT("比利时 · 伊普尔东北"),TEXT("Belgium · Northeast of Ypres")},
{TEXT("英军在伊普尔突出部发动新攻势。炮火毁坏农田和排水渠，雨水填满弹坑；防御越来越依赖孤立支点、机枪和能够及时投入的预备队。"),TEXT("The British launch another offensive from the Ypres salient. Guns destroy farmland and drainage channels; rain fills the craters. Defence increasingly rests on isolated strongpoints, machine guns and reserves committed at the right moment.")},
{TEXT("中央支点必须有部队实际驻守。以两处枪位组成交叉掩护，让军士组织轮换；英军狙击手出现时，用烟幕打断他的观察。"),TEXT("The central strongpoint needs a real garrison. Arrange two gun positions for mutual cover and use NCOs to organise reliefs. When British snipers appear, break their observation with smoke.")},
{TEXT("深泥延误反击，阵雨与低空烟雾限制射程。守军也必须为转移预留时间。"),TEXT("Deep mud delays counterattacks. Showers and low smoke reduce range. Defenders must also allow time to change position.")},
{TEXT("康布雷：反击令"),TEXT("Cambrai: counterattack orders")},
{TEXT("法国 · 康布雷突出部"),TEXT("France · Cambrai Salient")},
{TEXT("英军在康布雷的推进已经形成突出部。德军集结兵力，从薄弱地段反击，突击战术与突然炮击被用来切开尚未稳固的英军防御。"),TEXT("The British advance at Cambrai has formed a salient. German forces assemble against its weaker sectors. Assault tactics and a sudden barrage are intended to cut through defences that have not yet consolidated.")},
{TEXT("让投弹班从被压制的枪位之间渗入。机枪持续掩护，后续步兵负责占壕；抢到前沿后不要只顾继续冲锋，及时挡住英军增援。"),TEXT("Let bombers infiltrate between suppressed gun positions. Machine guns cover them and following infantry occupy the trenches. Once the front is taken, stop to intercept British reinforcements before pressing on.")},
{TEXT("坚实地面有利于迅速接近，开放射界也会惩罚没有烟幕和机枪掩护的进攻。"),TEXT("Firm ground favours a rapid approach, but open fields of fire punish attacks without smoke or machine-gun cover.")},
{TEXT("风暴迫近"),TEXT("The storm approaches")},
{TEXT("法国 · 圣康坦战区"),TEXT("France · Saint-Quentin sector")},
{TEXT("“米夏埃尔”攻势开始。急促炮击打击炮兵、联络和支点，突击部队越过薄弱处，把顽强抵抗的阵地留给后续梯队处理。新式 MP18 开始投入春季攻势。"),TEXT("Operation Michael begins. A violent bombardment strikes guns, communications and strongpoints. Assault troops pass through weak sectors, leaving stubborn positions to following waves. The new MP 18 begins to appear during the spring offensive.")},
{TEXT("已受训的风暴突击队现在配发 MP18。利用晨雾接近，再以短促自动火力压住壕口；机枪和步枪班跟进占领，避免突击组被孤立在前方。"),TEXT("Trained stormtroopers now receive the MP 18. Approach through the morning mist and pin the trench mouth with short automatic bursts. Machine guns and rifles must follow to consolidate; do not leave the assault section isolated ahead.")},
{TEXT("浓雾缩短接敌距离，适合渗透却难以互相支援。弹鼓容量有限，留出整备间隙。"),TEXT("Dense fog shortens contact distances. It favours infiltration but hinders mutual support. Drum magazines are finite; allow time to prepare again.")},
{TEXT("亚眠的后沿"),TEXT("Behind the line at Amiens")},
{TEXT("协约军的突然进攻压向亚眠东部。前沿在雾中失去联络，局部守军必须拖住进攻，为后方重新组织争取时间；守住一段交通壕已经足以改变这支连队的命运。"),TEXT("The Allied surprise attack bears down east of Amiens. Forward posts lose contact in the mist. Local defenders must delay the attack while the rear reorganises. Holding one stretch of communication trench can change this company's fate.")},
{TEXT("中央壕是后撤的通路。机枪分散设置，风暴队作为近壕反击预备队；辨认英军狙击手和观察员，别把所有弹鼓消耗在远处的人影上。"),TEXT("The central trench is the withdrawal route. Disperse the machine guns and keep stormtroopers ready for close counterattacks. Identify British snipers and observers; do not empty every drum at distant targets.")},
{TEXT("晨雾和湿润农田交错。保存完整小队比盲目推进更重要，烟幕可以掩护换位。"),TEXT("Morning mist lies over damp farmland. Preserving complete sections matters more than a blind advance. Smoke can cover a change of position.")},
{TEXT("中央壕连续驻守 150 秒；亦可击溃敌军"),TEXT("Secure the central position and break the enemy's resistance")},
{TEXT("中央壕连续驻守 120 秒；亦可击溃敌军"),TEXT("Secure the central position and break the enemy's resistance")},
{TEXT("中央壕连续驻守 100 秒；亦可击溃敌军"),TEXT("Secure the central position and break the enemy's resistance")},
{TEXT("行动准备未能完成，请返回作战室重试。"),TEXT("The operation could not be prepared. Return to the operations room and try again.")},
{TEXT("行动尚未准备妥当。请返回作战室后重试。"),TEXT("The operation is not ready. Return to the operations room and try again.")},
{TEXT("行动命令 / %02d"),TEXT("Operation orders / %02d")},
{TEXT("突破末端防线，或击垮敌军士气。"),TEXT("Break through the final line or break enemy morale.")},
{TEXT("即将进入战场…"),TEXT("Entering the battlefield…")},
{TEXT("整备尚未完成"),TEXT("Preparations are incomplete")},
{TEXT("西线"),TEXT("Western Front")},
{TEXT("第 %d 道战壕"),TEXT("Trench %d")},
{TEXT("%s · 选择覆盖地段"),TEXT("%s · Choose the area to cover")},
{TEXT("选择炮击落点。炮弹延迟抵达，爆炸会伤及友军。"),TEXT("Choose an area for the barrage. Shells arrive after a delay and can kill friendly troops.")},
{TEXT("选择烟幕落点，削弱双方穿烟直射，为出壕争取时间。"),TEXT("Lay smoke between your men and an enemy gun. Use the screen to cross open ground, change trenches, or deny observers a clear shot at your armour. Both armies lose sight through it; shells still pass through.")},
{TEXT("选择迫击炮目标。炮弹需要时间抵达，友军须避开弹着区。"),TEXT("Choose a mortar target. Shells take time to arrive; keep friendly troops clear of the impact area.")},
{TEXT("选择迫击炮目标。炮弹需要时间抵达，友军须避开弹着区。"),TEXT("Choose a mortar target. Shells take time to arrive; keep friendly troops clear of the impact area."),TEXT("选择轻迫击炮落点，三轮覆盖，首弹延迟抵达，注意友军。")},
{TEXT("选择迫击炮目标。炮弹需要时间抵达，友军须避开弹着区。"),TEXT("Choose a mortar target. Shells take time to arrive; keep friendly troops clear of the impact area."),TEXT("Choose an area for the light trench mortar. Three salvos follow after a delay. Keep friendly troops clear.")},
{TEXT("选择集结位置，帮助附近友军摆脱压制并恢复士气。"),TEXT("Choose a rally point to help nearby troops recover from suppression and regain morale.")},
{TEXT("选择集结位置，帮助附近友军摆脱压制并恢复士气。"),TEXT("Choose a rally point to help nearby troops recover from suppression and regain morale."),TEXT("选择友军集结位置，缓解受压并鼓舞士气。")},
{TEXT("选择集结位置，帮助附近友军摆脱压制并恢复士气。"),TEXT("Choose a rally point to help nearby troops recover from suppression and regain morale."),TEXT("Choose a friendly assembly point to relieve suppression and restore morale.")},
{TEXT("等待开始行动"),TEXT("Awaiting the start of the operation")},
{TEXT("继续战斗后下令"),TEXT("Resume the battle to issue orders")},
{TEXT("已达到 8 支小队的上限"),TEXT("Section limit reached: 8")},
{TEXT("已达到 8 支小队的上限"),TEXT("Section limit reached: 8"),TEXT("已达 8 小队上限")},
{TEXT("已达到 8 支小队的上限"),TEXT("Section limit reached: 8"),TEXT("No further sections can be called at present")},
{TEXT("小队正在整备"),TEXT("The section is preparing")},
{TEXT("请选择友方战壕"),TEXT("Select a friendly trench")},
{TEXT("壕内没有可出击的小队"),TEXT("No section in this trench can advance")},
{TEXT("炮兵正在装填"),TEXT("The artillery is reloading")},
{TEXT("所选战壕的全部小队正在前进。"),TEXT("All available sections in the selected trench are advancing.")},
{TEXT("守住战线，敌军正在向中央战壕推进。"),TEXT("Hold your line. The enemy is moving for the central trench.")},
{TEXT("一处战壕失守，我军防线承压。"),TEXT("A trench has fallen. Our line is under pressure.")},
{TEXT("增援已抵达，可点击己方战壕下达前进命令。"),TEXT("Reinforcements have arrived. Select a friendly trench to order an advance.")},
{TEXT("增援已抵达，可点击己方战壕下达前进命令。"),TEXT("Reinforcements have arrived. Select a friendly trench to order an advance."),TEXT("增援已就位。选中友壕，准备下一次前进。")},
{TEXT("增援已抵达，可点击己方战壕下达前进命令。"),TEXT("Reinforcements have arrived. Select a friendly trench to order an advance."),TEXT("Reinforcements are in position. Select a friendly trench and prepare the next advance.")},
{TEXT("炮火即将抵达，让友军离开标记区。"),TEXT("Fire is approaching. Move friendly troops clear of the marked area.")},
{TEXT("炮火即将抵达，让友军离开标记区。"),TEXT("Fire is approaching. Move friendly troops clear of the marked area."),TEXT("炮兵已开火。立即离开标记区，炮弹会伤及友军。")},
{TEXT("炮火即将抵达，让友军离开标记区。"),TEXT("Fire is approaching. Move friendly troops clear of the marked area."),TEXT("The guns have opened fire. Keep clear of the target area; shells can kill friendly troops.")},
