{TEXT("没有人独自越过战线。"),TEXT("No one crosses the line alone.")},
{TEXT("01  补员与整备"),TEXT("01  Reinforcements and preparation")},
{TEXT("02  战壕与前进"),TEXT("02  Trenches and the advance")},
{TEXT("03  炮火支援"),TEXT("03  Fire support")},
