{TEXT("点击肖像征募本次配属的小队。步兵共用整备队列，整备完成且前方有空位时可再次征募。精确射手优先攻击机枪手，军士缓解附近友军的压制。"),TEXT("Select a portrait to recruit an assigned section. Infantry share a readiness queue; recruit again when preparation is complete and there is room ahead. Marksmen prioritise machine gunners, while NCOs relieve suppression on nearby allies.")},
{TEXT("点击肖像征募本次配属的小队。步兵共用整备队列，整备完成且前方有空位时可再次征募。精确射手优先攻击机枪手，军士缓解附近友军的压制。"),TEXT("Select a portrait to recruit an assigned section. Infantry share a readiness queue; recruit again when preparation is complete and there is room ahead. Marksmen prioritise machine gunners, while NCOs relieve suppression on nearby allies."),TEXT("从肖像召集本次配属的小队。补员共用整备队列；肖像阴影退去且前方有接纳余量即可再次召集。精确射手优先打击机枪；军士以口令缓解同壕压制。")},
{TEXT("点击肖像征募本次配属的小队。步兵共用整备队列，整备完成且前方有空位时可再次征募。精确射手优先攻击机枪手，军士缓解附近友军的压制。"),TEXT("Select a portrait to recruit an assigned section. Infantry share a readiness queue; recruit again when preparation is complete and there is room ahead. Marksmen prioritise machine gunners, while NCOs relieve suppression on nearby allies."),TEXT("Call the sections assigned to this action from their portraits. Reinforcements share a preparation queue; call again when the portrait's shadow clears. Marksmen watch for machine guns, while NCOs use orders to relieve suppression in their trench.")},
{TEXT("每壕 3 席，靠近战壕显示驻军；点击小队头像即出击。关闭入壕后，后续部队继续向前，驻军不动；满员友壕也可通过。也可让当前战壕整队出击。敌军驻守的战壕必须先夺下。"),TEXT("Each trench holds three sections. Move the pointer near it to reveal its garrison; select a portrait to advance that section. Closing entry sends arrivals onward without moving the garrison. Full friendly trenches can be passed. You may also order the whole trench forward. Enemy-occupied trenches must first be captured.")},
{TEXT("野炮、烟幕与壕炮分开联络；毒气、反装甲野炮和飞机随行动配属。在纵深范围内指定覆盖地段，再等待弹药抵达。炮火、毒气与扫射不分敌我；烟幕遮挡双方观察。"),TEXT("Field guns, smoke and trench mortars have separate liaison. Gas, anti-armour guns and aircraft are attached as the campaign develops. Select an area, then wait for ammunition to arrive. Shells, gas and strafing threaten both armies. Lay smoke between your men and enemy guns to cross open ground or conceal a change of position; it blinds both sides but does not stop shells.")},
{TEXT("按行动命令夺取并守住阵地；突破敌方后方防线，或将敌军士气压至零也能取胜。伤亡与失守会削弱士气。预备队可接替伤兵，并支援受困的小队。"),TEXT("Follow the operation's orders to take and hold positions. Breaking through the enemy rear line or reducing enemy morale to zero also wins. Casualties and lost ground weaken morale. Keep reserves to relieve depleted sections and support those under pressure.")},
{TEXT("按行动命令夺取并守住阵地；突破敌方后方防线，或将敌军士气压至零也能取胜。伤亡与失守会削弱士气。预备队可接替伤兵，并支援受困的小队。"),TEXT("Follow the operation's orders to take and hold positions. Breaking through the enemy rear line or reducing enemy morale to zero also wins. Casualties and lost ground weaken morale. Keep reserves to relieve depleted sections and support those under pressure."),TEXT("按行动命令夺取并守住阵地；突破敌方远端防线，或将敌军士气压至零也能取胜。伤亡与失守都会动摇士气。保留预备队，别让零散步兵逐队送入机枪火力。")},
{TEXT("按行动命令夺取并守住阵地；突破敌方后方防线，或将敌军士气压至零也能取胜。伤亡与失守会削弱士气。预备队可接替伤兵，并支援受困的小队。"),TEXT("Follow the operation's orders to take and hold positions. Breaking through the enemy rear line or reducing enemy morale to zero also wins. Casualties and lost ground weaken morale. Keep reserves to relieve depleted sections and support those under pressure."),TEXT("Follow the operation's orders: secure key positions, break through the enemy rear line, or destroy enemy morale. Casualties and lost positions shake morale. Keep a reserve instead of feeding isolated sections into a machine gun one at a time.")},
{TEXT("E / C / V · 鼠标右键取消"),TEXT("E / C / V · Right-click to cancel")},
{TEXT("A / D 水平 · W / S 纵深 · 滚轮缩放"),TEXT("A / D horizontal · W / S depth · Wheel to zoom")},
{TEXT("F 返回后方 · Space 暂停 · H 手册"),TEXT("F return to rear · Space pause · H manual")},
{TEXT("暂时无法开始行动"),TEXT("The operation cannot begin yet")},
{TEXT("行动准备未能完成。请返回作战室后重试。"),TEXT("The operation could not be prepared. Return to the operations room and try again.")},
{TEXT("重新开始"),TEXT("Restart")},
{TEXT("战术菜单"),TEXT("Tactical menu")},
{TEXT("战场尚未准备完成"),TEXT("The battlefield is not ready yet")},
{TEXT("战斗已暂停，可调整命令后继续。"),TEXT("The battle is paused. Adjust your orders and resume when ready.")},
{TEXT("战斗已暂停，可调整命令后继续。"),TEXT("The battle is paused. Adjust your orders and resume when ready."),TEXT("时间已暂停。整理下一步命令，然后回到前线。")},
{TEXT("战斗已暂停，可调整命令后继续。"),TEXT("The battle is paused. Adjust your orders and resume when ready."),TEXT("Time is paused. Review your next orders, then return to the line.")},
{TEXT("行动准备未能完成，请重新开始。"),TEXT("The operation could not be prepared. Please restart.")},
{TEXT("返回前线"),TEXT("Return to the line")},
{TEXT("战地手册"),TEXT("Field manual")},
{TEXT("重新开始行动"),TEXT("Restart operation")},
{TEXT("放弃战斗，返回作战室"),TEXT("Abandon battle and return to operations")},
{TEXT("撤回本次行动，保留战役进度。"),TEXT("Withdraw from this action. Campaign progress is retained.")},
{TEXT("英军"),TEXT("British")},
{TEXT("德军"),TEXT("German")},
{TEXT("Schilt 法军喷火分遣队"),TEXT("French Schilt flame detachment")},
{TEXT("Wex 喷火工兵"),TEXT("Wex flame pioneers")},
{TEXT("皇家工兵清障组"),TEXT("Royal Engineers clearance section")},
{TEXT("Pioniere 排障组"),TEXT("Pioniere clearance section")},
{TEXT("SMLE 狙击手"),TEXT("SMLE snipers")},
{TEXT("Webley 军官观察组"),TEXT("Webley officer section")},
{TEXT("P08 突击军官组"),TEXT("P08 assault officer section")},
{TEXT("MP 18 突击队"),TEXT("MP 18 assault section")},
{TEXT("MG 08/15 机枪组"),TEXT("MG 08/15 gun section")},
{TEXT("Stielhandgranate 突击班"),TEXT("Stielhandgranate bombing section")},
{TEXT("Gewehr 98 精确射手"),TEXT("Gewehr 98 marksmen")},
{TEXT("德军军士组"),TEXT("German NCO section")},
{TEXT("Gewehr 98 步枪班"),TEXT("Gewehr 98 rifle section")},
{TEXT("军士的靶场"),TEXT("The sergeant's range")},
{TEXT("先稳住枪托，再扣扳机。反复练熟的 SMLE 射手，更能把弹药用在看清的目标上。"),TEXT("Stock into the shoulder; then the trigger. Repeated SMLE practice teaches a rifleman to spend his ammunition on a target he can identify.")},
{TEXT("步兵协同"),TEXT("Infantry cooperation")},
{TEXT("手指记住的动作"),TEXT("The hands remember")},
{TEXT("桥夹、弹盘，各有各的规矩。全连反复练习装填，交火中的空当便能短一些。"),TEXT("Charger clips and pan magazines each have their own drill. Repeated loading practice shortens the dangerous silence in a firefight.")},
{TEXT("刘易斯开路"),TEXT("The Lewis opens the way")},
{TEXT("枪手不必追逐每一名敌兵。短促火力压住敌人的枪口，让他们更难抬头还击。"),TEXT("A gunner need not chase every enemy. Short bursts pin hostile gun positions and make it harder for their crews to answer.")},
{TEXT("机枪支援"),TEXT("Machine-gun support")},
{TEXT("接通炮兵电话"),TEXT("Connect the artillery telephone")},
{TEXT("传令兵沿壕检查线路，炮位提早备弹。连部呼叫野炮时，整备的等待随之缩短。"),TEXT("Runners check the trench line and the battery prepares ammunition in advance. When company headquarters calls, the guns need less time to get ready.")},
{TEXT("步炮联络"),TEXT("Infantry–artillery liaison")},
{TEXT("转角后的 Mills"),TEXT("A Mills bomb round the corner")},
{TEXT("投弹手学会辨认壕道中的暴露处。落点仍会偏离，但近处的爆炸更有机会击中守军。"),TEXT("Bombers learn to recognise exposed places in the trench. A throw can still stray, but a close explosion is more likely to catch the garrison.")},
{TEXT("突击整备"),TEXT("Assault preparation")},
{TEXT("交通壕里的补给队"),TEXT("Supply parties in the communication trench")},
{TEXT("弹药、口粮与替补人员沿交通壕送来。后方分工理顺，新的小队便能更快完成整备。"),TEXT("Ammunition, rations and replacements come forward through the communication trenches. Better work in the rear gets the next section ready sooner.")},
{TEXT("你掩护，我前进"),TEXT("You cover; we move")},
{TEXT("壕内的刘易斯刚刚开火，附近步兵便抓住机会向前。持续掩护能减轻他们跨越空地时的压制。"),TEXT("As the Lewis opens fire from its trench, nearby infantry seize their chance. Sustained cover reduces the pressure on men crossing open ground.")},
{TEXT("扫过整段壕肩"),TEXT("Traverse the whole parapet")},
{TEXT("枪手学会沿敌阵分配火力。被压住的枪位之外，周围的守军也更难从壕肩探头。"),TEXT("Gunners learn to distribute fire along the position. Men around a pinned gun also find it harder to raise their heads above the parapet.")},
{TEXT("别让枪口沉默"),TEXT("Keep the gun speaking")},
{TEXT("弹药手也要会用刘易斯。枪手阵亡后，存活的同伴会靠近枪位，接下剩余弹药与任务。"),TEXT("The ammunition bearer must know the Lewis too. If the gunner is killed, a surviving companion moves to the position and takes over the ammunition and the task.")},
{TEXT("一纸任命"),TEXT("A commission on paper")},
{TEXT("指挥组长获任军官，以 Webley 自卫，用口令稳住附近部队。学会前沿观察后，他也能为更远处的炮火指引方向。"),TEXT("The section leader receives a commission. A Webley protects him while his orders steady the men nearby. Observer training will later let him direct fire farther ahead.")},
{TEXT("炮位前方的眼睛"),TEXT("Eyes ahead of the battery")},
{TEXT("射手与指挥组长学会报告所见。目标处于清楚的视线内时，野炮和迫击炮能更早送来首轮火力。"),TEXT("Marksmen and command leaders learn to report what they see. A clearly observed target lets field guns and mortars deliver their first salvo sooner.")},
{TEXT("烟幕后续射"),TEXT("Fire beyond the smoke")},
{TEXT("己方烟幕标出需要继续压制的地段，野炮在末轮补射。炮手看不见冲进烟里的自己人，步兵仍须等待。"),TEXT("Friendly smoke marks the sector that needs continued suppression. The field guns add a final salvo. Gunners cannot see their own men entering the screen; infantry must still wait.")},
{TEXT("狙击学校的来信"),TEXT("A letter from the sniper school")},
{TEXT("精确射手完成专门操练，领到镜瞄 SMLE。更远处的枪口也能被辨认，沉住气的一枪更有把握。"),TEXT("Marksmen complete specialist training and receive telescopic SMLE rifles. They can identify more distant gun positions and place a deliberate shot with greater confidence.")},
{TEXT("狙击操练"),TEXT("Sniper instruction")},
{TEXT("先找指挥的人"),TEXT("Find the man giving orders")},
{TEXT("狙击手留意发号施令的敌军，再寻找机枪手。打断对方的组织，往往比追逐最近的散兵更有用。"),TEXT("Snipers watch first for enemy leaders, then machine gunners. Disrupting the opposing formation often matters more than chasing the nearest skirmisher.")},
{TEXT("跟着口令向前"),TEXT("Forward on the officer's word")},
{TEXT("军官刚下达命令，附近推进中的步兵便更能顶住枪火。抓住这段短暂的镇定，越过下一片空地。"),TEXT("Fresh orders steady nearby infantry already advancing under fire. Use that brief composure to cross the next patch of open ground.")},
{TEXT("趁安静时装满"),TEXT("Fill the magazine while it is quiet")},
{TEXT("壕里暂时没有交火、弹药又已不足时，士兵会主动完成装填。不要把准备下一次射击的事留到敌人冒头以后。"),TEXT("When the trench falls quiet and ammunition runs low, soldiers reload before the next exchange. Preparation should not wait until the enemy appears.")},
{TEXT("枪托紧贴肩窝"),TEXT("Stock firm in the shoulder")},
{TEXT("Gewehr 98 射手在操场上练稳呼吸与扳机。到了壕肩，每一发瞄准射击便多一分把握。"),TEXT("Gewehr 98 riflemen practise their breathing and trigger control on the range. At the parapet, each aimed shot carries a little more certainty.")},
{TEXT("纵深防御"),TEXT("Defence in depth")},
{TEXT("闭眼也能装填"),TEXT("Load without looking")},
{TEXT("泥水和紧张不能打乱手上的次序。各组反复操练自己的武器，让完整装填少耽搁一些时间。"),TEXT("Mud and fear must not break the sequence. Every crew repeats its own weapon drill so a full reload costs less time.")},
{TEXT("枪口听从口令"),TEXT("The gun follows the order")},
{TEXT("MG 08/15 按照射界分配点射。火力更有纪律，敌军就更难找到抬头与移动的间隙。"),TEXT("MG 08/15 crews distribute bursts within assigned arcs. Disciplined fire leaves the enemy fewer chances to raise a head or move.")},
{TEXT("机枪阵地"),TEXT("Machine-gun positions")},
{TEXT("连通后方炮位"),TEXT("Reconnect the rear batteries")},
{TEXT("联络所把前沿呼叫送向炮兵。炮位有了准备，第一轮与后续野炮任务都能更快整备。"),TEXT("The liaison post passes front-line calls to the artillery. Better preparation shortens the wait for both the first and later field-gun missions.")},
{TEXT("突击火力"),TEXT("Assault fire")},
{TEXT("壕道里的投弹手"),TEXT("Bombers in the trench")},
{TEXT("突击手学会寻找转角与坑岸旁的暴露处。柄式手榴弹仍会偏离，近处的爆炸却更有机会击中守军。"),TEXT("Assault troops learn to spot exposed places beside corners and crater lips. Stick grenades may still stray, but close explosions are more likely to catch the defenders.")},
{TEXT("突击分队"),TEXT("Assault sections")},
{TEXT("跟上前队的补给"),TEXT("Supplies behind the leading wave")},
{TEXT("补给人员理清交通壕中的次序。步枪、机枪与突击分队都能更快完成出发前的整备。"),TEXT("Supply parties establish an orderly route through the communication trenches. Rifles, guns and assault sections all complete their preparations sooner.")},
{TEXT("随前队下令"),TEXT("Orders with the leading men")},
{TEXT("指挥组长获任配 P08 的军官，推进中也能就近发出命令；留在壕里的步枪手则更善于压住冲来的敌人。"),TEXT("The command leader is commissioned and issued a P08, allowing him to give orders close to advancing troops. Riflemen remaining in the trench become better at pinning an approaching enemy.")},
{TEXT("把枪位藏进壕肩"),TEXT("Hide the gun in the parapet")},
{TEXT("挖深枪位，整理胸墙。驻壕机枪手更不容易被枪弹找到，也更能顶住扫来的压制火力。"),TEXT("Deepen the emplacement and dress the breastwork. Entrenched machine gunners become harder to hit and better able to withstand suppressive fire.")},
{TEXT("留下最后的枪口"),TEXT("Keep one gun behind")},
{TEXT("整壕出击时，有枪手的机枪组替步兵留守掩护。若壕内已没有别的步兵，它们仍可奉命向前。"),TEXT("When a trench advances, machine-gun sections with a living gunner remain to cover the infantry. If no other infantry remain in the trench, the guns can still be ordered forward.")},
{TEXT("沿烟的边缘渗入"),TEXT("Infiltrate along the smoke")},
{TEXT("突击班在己方烟幕内更能顶住枪火，并把交火距离留得更近。先穿过空地，再让壕口听见你的武器。"),TEXT("Assault sections withstand fire better inside friendly smoke and hold their fire for closer contact. Cross the open ground before making the trench mouth hear your weapons.")},
{TEXT("炮手的测地本"),TEXT("The gunner's survey book")},
{TEXT("迫击炮组把测地记录与火力表核对清楚。弹着不再散得那么开，爆炸本身却不会因此缩小。"),TEXT("Mortar crews reconcile their survey notes and firing tables. Their rounds fall in a tighter area; the explosions themselves do not become smaller.")},
{TEXT("趁守军低头时"),TEXT("While the defenders keep their heads down")},
{TEXT("炮火把壕里的敌人压住，投弹手便抓紧接近。面对已经深受压制的守军，手雷更容易找到目标。"),TEXT("As the barrage pins the trench, bombers close quickly. Grenades have a better chance against defenders already under heavy suppression.")},
{TEXT("风暴队的新枪"),TEXT("A new gun for the storm section")},
{TEXT("春季攻势的突击班接受 MP 18 操练，以弹鼓供弹的短点射对付近处壕口。枪声急促，跟进步兵仍不可缺。"),TEXT("Spring assault sections train with the MP 18. Short, drum-fed bursts strike nearby trench mouths. The firing is rapid, but following infantry remain essential.")},
{TEXT("让火线相交"),TEXT("Make the fields of fire cross")},
{TEXT("分开的驻壕机枪同时盯住同一通路，交叉火力会让敌人更难行动。挤在一起的枪位得不到这样的好处。"),TEXT("Separate entrenched guns watch the same approach. Their crossfire makes enemy movement harder. Guns crowded together gain no such advantage.")},
{TEXT("扫过近处壕口"),TEXT("Sweep the trench mouth")},
{TEXT("MP 18 突击手练习把短点射送进近处阵位。目标身边的守军也会被这阵突然的火力压住。"),TEXT("MP 18 troops practise short bursts against close positions. Defenders beside the target are also pinned by the sudden fire.")},
{TEXT("留一只满弹鼓"),TEXT("Keep a full drum ready")},
{TEXT("壕里安静下来、弹鼓已经消耗不少时，风暴队会主动更换。下一次近处交火，不该从空枪声开始。"),TEXT("When the trench becomes quiet and the drum is partly spent, stormtroopers change it before the next fight. Close combat should not begin with an empty gun.")},
{TEXT("项目不可用"),TEXT("This training is unavailable")},
{TEXT("请先选择战役"),TEXT("Select a campaign first")},
{TEXT("战后整备时研习"),TEXT("Training is available between battles")},
{TEXT("已研习"),TEXT("Training completed")},
{TEXT("需要：%s"),TEXT("Requires: %s")},
{TEXT("研究点不足"),TEXT("Not enough research points")},
{TEXT("研究点不足"),TEXT("Not enough research points"),TEXT("战绩点不足")},
{TEXT("%s · 准备出战"),TEXT("%s · Ready for action")},
{TEXT("档案读取异常 · 原文件已保留"),TEXT("The record could not be read. The original file has been preserved")},
{TEXT("旧档备份失败，原档已保留"),TEXT("The old record could not be backed up. The original has been preserved")},
{TEXT("档案已载入"),TEXT("Record loaded")},
{TEXT("旧战役研究已独立保存"),TEXT("Previous campaign research has been saved separately")},
{TEXT("档案已保存"),TEXT("Record saved")},
{TEXT("档案保存失败，请检查磁盘权限"),TEXT("The record could not be saved. Check disk permissions")},
{TEXT("请更新显卡驱动"),TEXT("Update your graphics driver")},
{TEXT("请更新 Windows"),TEXT("Update Windows")},
{TEXT("需要 NVIDIA RTX 显卡"),TEXT("An NVIDIA RTX graphics card is required")},
{TEXT("请关闭图形捕获工具"),TEXT("Close graphics capture tools")},
{TEXT("当前渲染模式不可用"),TEXT("Unavailable in the current rendering mode")},
{TEXT("需开启 Windows GPU 调度"),TEXT("Enable Windows hardware-accelerated GPU scheduling")},
{TEXT("当前显卡不支持"),TEXT("Unsupported by the current graphics card")},
{TEXT("当前 HDR scRGB 输出不支持帧生成"),TEXT("Frame generation is unavailable with the current HDR scRGB output")},
{TEXT("帧生成需要关闭垂直同步"),TEXT("Frame generation requires vertical sync to be disabled")},
{TEXT("需要开启光线追踪"),TEXT("Ray tracing must be enabled")},
{TEXT("机枪停稳架设后开火，同伴保护枪手。"),TEXT("Machine guns fire after halting and deploying. Companions protect the gunner.")},
{TEXT("机枪停稳架设后开火，同伴保护枪手。"),TEXT("Machine guns fire after halting and deploying. Companions protect the gunner."),TEXT("架设机枪形成压制，副射手伴随掩护。")},
{TEXT("机枪停稳架设后开火，同伴保护枪手。"),TEXT("Machine guns fire after halting and deploying. Companions protect the gunner."),TEXT("Deploy the gun for suppressive fire. The assistant stays alongside to provide cover.")},
{TEXT("突击队用手榴弹清理近壕，穿越空地时需要掩护。"),TEXT("Assault troops clear nearby trenches with grenades. They need cover in the open.")},
{TEXT("突击队用手榴弹清理近壕，穿越空地时需要掩护。"),TEXT("Assault troops clear nearby trenches with grenades. They need cover in the open."),TEXT("贴近敌壕，以手榴弹打破顽抗；开阔地带需要掩护。")},
{TEXT("突击队用手榴弹清理近壕，穿越空地时需要掩护。"),TEXT("Assault troops clear nearby trenches with grenades. They need cover in the open."),TEXT("Close on the enemy trench and break resistance with grenades. Cover is essential across open ground.")},
{TEXT("观察并优先打击敌方机枪，保持射界。"),TEXT("Observe the enemy guns and keep a clear field of fire.")},
{TEXT("伴随部队，下令重整，缓解压制。"),TEXT("Accompany the men, issue rallying orders and relieve suppression.")},
{TEXT("喷火器需抵近才能发挥作用，火焰可逼退掩体后的守军；让步兵掩护操作手。"),TEXT("Flamethrowers must approach close to cover. Keep infantry protecting the operator while flame forces defenders from shelter.")},
{TEXT("工兵清除铁丝和爆炸物，为后续部队开路。"),TEXT("Pioneers clear wire and explosives for the following troops.")},
{TEXT("工兵清除铁丝和爆炸物，为后续部队开路。"),TEXT("Pioneers clear wire and explosives for the following troops."),TEXT("工兵沿推进方向开辟铁丝网和爆炸物通道，身后的部队可沿缺口通过。")},
{TEXT("工兵清除铁丝和爆炸物，为后续部队开路。"),TEXT("Pioneers clear wire and explosives for the following troops."),TEXT("Pioneers clear passages through wire and explosives along the advance. Following troops can use the gap.")},
{TEXT("步枪班夺取并驻守战壕，推进时需要火力掩护。"),TEXT("Rifle sections take and hold trenches. Advances need covering fire.")},
{TEXT("步枪班夺取并驻守战壕，推进时需要火力掩护。"),TEXT("Rifle sections take and hold trenches. Advances need covering fire."),TEXT("用步枪火力掩护前进，夺取并驻守阵地。")},
{TEXT("步枪班夺取并驻守战壕，推进时需要火力掩护。"),TEXT("Rifle sections take and hold trenches. Advances need covering fire."),TEXT("Use rifle fire to cover the advance, capture positions and hold them.")},
{TEXT("支援不可用。"),TEXT("Support is unavailable.")},
{TEXT("由前线军士就地指挥。"),TEXT("Directed locally by the front-line NCO.")},
{TEXT("该支援仍在整备。"),TEXT("This support formation is still preparing.")},
{TEXT("请选择战线上的有效落点。"),TEXT("Choose a valid point on the battlefield.")},
{TEXT("烟幕暂不可用，整备已保留。"),TEXT("Smoke is temporarily unavailable. Preparation has been retained.")},
{TEXT("烟幕已受理 · 约 5–7 秒后分三次起烟"),TEXT("Smoke acknowledged. Three releases follow in about 5–7 seconds.")},
{TEXT("附近没有可集结的友军。"),TEXT("No friendly troops nearby can be rallied.")},
{TEXT("集结生效：解除压制、恢复士气，14 秒内加快推进与射击。"),TEXT("Rally orders received. Suppression is relieved, morale restored, and advance and fire quicken briefly.")},
{TEXT("迫击炮已受理 · 观测联络 · 约 12–16 秒后分三组覆盖"),TEXT("Mortars acknowledged. Observers are ranging; three salvos follow in about 12–16 seconds.")},
{TEXT("迫击炮已受理 · 约 14–18 秒后分三组覆盖"),TEXT("Mortars acknowledged. Three salvos follow in about 14–18 seconds.")},
{TEXT("Feuerwalze 徐进弹幕"),TEXT("Feuerwalze creeping barrage")},
{TEXT("步兵协同徐进弹幕"),TEXT("Infantry creeping barrage")},
{TEXT("侦察航空队"),TEXT("Reconnaissance flight")},
{TEXT("皇家空军联络巡逻"),TEXT("RAF contact patrol")},
{TEXT("航空炸弹袭击"),TEXT("Aerial bombing raid")},
{TEXT("低空投弹编队"),TEXT("Low-level bombing flight")},
{TEXT("7.7 cm 野炮齐射"),TEXT("7.7 cm field-gun salvo")},
{TEXT("18 磅野炮齐射"),TEXT("18-pounder salvo")},
{TEXT("烟幕弹幕"),TEXT("Smoke barrage")},
{TEXT("Minenwerfer 壕炮"),TEXT("Minenwerfer trench mortar")},
{TEXT("Stokes 迫击炮"),TEXT("Stokes mortar")},
{TEXT("毒气弹幕"),TEXT("Gas barrage")},
{TEXT("野炮直射 · 反装甲"),TEXT("Field gun · Direct anti-armour fire")},
{TEXT("18 磅炮 · 反装甲"),TEXT("18-pounder · Anti-armour fire")},
{TEXT("Halberstadt CL.II 扫射"),TEXT("Halberstadt CL.II strafing run")},
{TEXT("Bristol F.2B 扫射"),TEXT("Bristol F.2B strafing run")},
{TEXT("前沿联络"),TEXT("Front-line liaison")},
{TEXT("弹幕逐段向敌后推进，压制沿途阵地。步兵可在炮火经过后跟进，须与弹着区保持距离，避免遭到己方炮击。"),TEXT("The barrage advances into enemy positions in stages. Infantry can follow after the fire passes, keeping clear of the impact area to avoid friendly shellfire.")},
{TEXT("弹幕逐段向敌后推进，压制沿途阵地。步兵可在炮火经过后跟进，须与弹着区保持距离，避免遭到己方炮击。"),TEXT("The barrage advances into enemy positions in stages. Infantry can follow after the fire passes, keeping clear of the impact area to avoid friendly shellfire."),TEXT("炮弹由标定地段逐段向敌后延伸。步兵须紧随烟尘，踏得过早也会撞上自己的炮火。")},
{TEXT("弹幕逐段向敌后推进，压制沿途阵地。步兵可在炮火经过后跟进，须与弹着区保持距离，避免遭到己方炮击。"),TEXT("The barrage advances into enemy positions in stages. Infantry can follow after the fire passes, keeping clear of the impact area to avoid friendly shellfire."),TEXT("The barrage advances from the registered line in stages. Infantry must follow the smoke and dust; moving too soon puts them under their own shells.")},
{TEXT("联络机飞越指定地段，为炮兵提供临时观察。烟幕仍会遮住地面部队的视线。"),TEXT("A contact aircraft crosses the selected sector and provides temporary artillery observation. Smoke still obscures the view of ground troops.")},
{TEXT("联络机飞越指定地段，为炮兵提供临时观察。烟幕仍会遮住地面部队的视线。"),TEXT("A contact aircraft crosses the selected sector and provides temporary artillery observation. Smoke still obscures the view of ground troops."),TEXT("联络机飞越指定战线，临时为炮兵校射。浓烟仍会遮住地面枪手，飞行员不能替他们扣动扳机。")},
{TEXT("联络机飞越指定地段，为炮兵提供临时观察。烟幕仍会遮住地面部队的视线。"),TEXT("A contact aircraft crosses the selected sector and provides temporary artillery observation. Smoke still obscures the view of ground troops."),TEXT("A contact aircraft crosses the assigned sector and temporarily helps the artillery observe. Smoke still hides targets from ground troops; the pilot cannot aim their rifles for them.")},
{TEXT("飞机沿指定航线连续投下十二枚炸弹。航线在下令时固定，移动目标可能在炸弹抵达前离开；友军须避开轰炸带。"),TEXT("The aircraft releases twelve bombs along the selected flight path. The path is fixed when ordered, so moving targets may leave before impact. Friendly troops must keep clear of the bombing lane.")},
{TEXT("飞机沿指定航线连续投下十二枚炸弹。航线在下令时固定，移动目标可能在炸弹抵达前离开；友军须避开轰炸带。"),TEXT("The aircraft releases twelve bombs along the selected flight path. The path is fixed when ordered, so moving targets may leave before impact. Friendly troops must keep clear of the bombing lane."),TEXT("飞机抵达后连续投下八枚炸弹。落弹横向散开，沟通迟缓与气流决定了它无法代替精确射击。")},
{TEXT("飞机沿指定航线连续投下十二枚炸弹。航线在下令时固定，移动目标可能在炸弹抵达前离开；友军须避开轰炸带。"),TEXT("The aircraft releases twelve bombs along the selected flight path. The path is fixed when ordered, so moving targets may leave before impact. Friendly troops must keep clear of the bombing lane."),TEXT("The aircraft releases eight bombs in succession. Their spread, uncertain communications and shifting air make bombing a poor substitute for a precise shot.")},
{TEXT("炮位接令后分轮覆盖指定地段。落弹分散，进攻的自己人也必须等炮火停下。"),TEXT("The battery covers the selected area in several salvos. Rounds are dispersed; your own advancing men must wait until the fire lifts.")},
{TEXT("烟幕分次铺开，掩住双方的观察。趁遮蔽转移，别指望隔着浓烟瞄准。"),TEXT("Lay smoke between your men and an enemy gun. Use the screen to cross open ground, change trenches, or deny observers a clear shot at your armour. Both armies lose sight through it; shells still pass through.")},
{TEXT("迫击炮接令、瞄准后进行多轮炮击，适合打击固定枪位。响应较慢，移动步兵可能在炮弹抵达前离开。"),TEXT("After receiving the order and laying the gun, the mortar fires several salvos at fixed positions. Its slow response lets moving infantry leave before impact.")},
{TEXT("迫击炮接令、瞄准后进行多轮炮击，适合打击固定枪位。响应较慢，移动步兵可能在炮弹抵达前离开。"),TEXT("After receiving the order and laying the gun, the mortar fires several salvos at fixed positions. Its slow response lets moving infantry leave before impact."),TEXT("壕炮要先传令、装定，再送来数轮落弹。适合打散停留的枪位，不适合追逐奔跑的散兵。")},
{TEXT("迫击炮接令、瞄准后进行多轮炮击，适合打击固定枪位。响应较慢，移动步兵可能在炮弹抵达前离开。"),TEXT("After receiving the order and laying the gun, the mortar fires several salvos at fixed positions. Its slow response lets moving infantry leave before impact."),TEXT("Orders must be relayed and the mortar laid before several salvos arrive. It can break up stationary gun positions, but cannot follow every running skirmisher.")},
{TEXT("气弹在指定地段散落，毒云随风漂移，遮蔽观察并杀伤持续暴露的步兵。毒气也会伤及友军，烟幕无法提供防毒保护。"),TEXT("Gas shells scatter over the selected ground. The drifting cloud obscures sight and harms infantry who remain exposed, including friendly troops. Smoke provides no gas protection.")},
{TEXT("气弹在指定地段散落，毒云随风漂移，遮蔽观察并杀伤持续暴露的步兵。毒气也会伤及友军，烟幕无法提供防毒保护。"),TEXT("Gas shells scatter over the selected ground. The drifting cloud obscures sight and harms infantry who remain exposed, including friendly troops. Smoke provides no gas protection."),TEXT("气弹在指定地段散落，低处的毒云随风偏移。它会阻断观察、压住枪位，久留有致死危险；风不分敌我。")},
{TEXT("气弹在指定地段散落，毒云随风漂移，遮蔽观察并杀伤持续暴露的步兵。毒气也会伤及友军，烟幕无法提供防毒保护。"),TEXT("Gas shells scatter over the selected ground. The drifting cloud obscures sight and harms infantry who remain exposed, including friendly troops. Smoke provides no gas protection."),TEXT("Gas shells scatter over the selected ground. Low clouds drift with the wind, obscure observation and threaten crews who remain exposed. Research respirators before entering gas; smoke provides no protection from it.")},
{TEXT("野炮以直射迎击指定地段内可见的装甲。命中可能打断履带；坦克离开目标区域后，炮手停止追击。"),TEXT("The field gun engages visible armour with direct fire in the selected area. Hits may break tracks; the crew stops engaging a tank once it leaves the target area.")},
{TEXT("野炮以直射迎击指定地段内可见的装甲。命中可能打断履带；坦克离开目标区域后，炮手停止追击。"),TEXT("The field gun engages visible armour with direct fire in the selected area. Hits may break tracks; the crew stops engaging a tank once it leaves the target area."),TEXT("野炮转为直射，分次瞄准指定地段内看得见的装甲。近弹可打断履带；目标离开后，炮手不会追着整条战线射击。")},
{TEXT("野炮以直射迎击指定地段内可见的装甲。命中可能打断履带；坦克离开目标区域后，炮手停止追击。"),TEXT("The field gun engages visible armour with direct fire in the selected area. Hits may break tracks; the crew stops engaging a tank once it leaves the target area."),TEXT("The field gun switches to direct fire, engaging visible armour in the selected area. Near hits can break tracks. Once the target leaves, the crew does not pursue it along the entire front.")},
{TEXT("双翼机低空扫射指定地段，适合打击暴露步兵。机枪弹无法击穿坦克装甲。"),TEXT("A biplane makes low strafing passes over the selected area, attacking exposed infantry. Its machine-gun rounds cannot penetrate tank armour.")},
{TEXT("双翼机低空扫射指定地段，适合打击暴露步兵。机枪弹无法击穿坦克装甲。"),TEXT("A biplane makes low strafing passes over the selected area, attacking exposed infantry. Its machine-gun rounds cannot penetrate tank armour."),TEXT("双翼机从战线外低空掠入，沿指定地段来回扫射。弹线能压住暴露步兵，却不能像重炮一样击穿坦克。")},
{TEXT("双翼机低空扫射指定地段，适合打击暴露步兵。机枪弹无法击穿坦克装甲。"),TEXT("A biplane makes low strafing passes over the selected area, attacking exposed infantry. Its machine-gun rounds cannot penetrate tank armour."),TEXT("A biplane enters low from beyond the line and strafes the assigned ground. Its fire can pin exposed infantry, but cannot penetrate tanks like heavy artillery.")},
{TEXT("这项支援将在“%s”行动中开放。"),TEXT("This support becomes available during “%s”.")},
{TEXT("这项支援将在“%s”行动中开放。"),TEXT("This support becomes available during “%s”."),TEXT("将在「%s」接通这项支援。")},
{TEXT("这项支援将在“%s”行动中开放。"),TEXT("This support becomes available during “%s”."),TEXT("This support connection opens at %s.")},
