{TEXT("%d / %d 人"),TEXT("%d / %d men")},
{TEXT("新增火力配属"),TEXT("New fire-support attachment")},
{TEXT("提前指定转移路线上的遮蔽地段。等烟幕铺开再推进；机枪手也会失去穿烟观察，别误以为只有敌人看不见。"),TEXT("Select a screening area along your intended route before moving. Wait for the smoke to spread. Your own machine gunners also lose observation through it; the screen does not blind only the enemy.")},
{TEXT("先观察敌军，再指定覆盖地段。支援需要时间抵达；落点确认后，及时让己方部队避开危险区域。"),TEXT("Observe the enemy before selecting the area. Support takes time to arrive. Once the target is confirmed, move friendly troops away from the danger.")},
{TEXT("装甲分队配属"),TEXT("Armour attached")},
{TEXT("车组从后方沿通路推进。履带受损会影响行进，机枪也可能失去作用；不要把战车单独送进敌方炮火。"),TEXT("The crew approaches along a route from the rear. Damaged tracks hinder movement and machine guns can be disabled separately. Do not send a tank alone into enemy gunfire.")},
{TEXT("军士的叮嘱"),TEXT("The sergeant's advice")},
{TEXT("上一页"),TEXT("Previous page")},
{TEXT("继续阅读"),TEXT("Read on")},
{TEXT("明白，准备出发"),TEXT("Understood. Ready to move")},
{TEXT("留守"),TEXT("Hold")},
{TEXT("前线停止抵抗。"),TEXT("Resistance at the front has ended.")},
{TEXT("Mark IV 雄型"),TEXT("Mark IV Male")},
{TEXT("Mark IV 雌型"),TEXT("Mark IV Female")},
{TEXT("缴获 Mark IV 雌型"),TEXT("Captured Mark IV Female")},
{TEXT("等待雌型坦克配属"),TEXT("Awaiting a female tank attachment")},
{TEXT("Mark IV Female 以机枪压制步兵，整备快于雄型。没有主炮，无法损伤坦克车体。"),TEXT("Mark IV Female suppresses infantry with machine guns and prepares sooner than the male. Without cannon, it cannot damage tank hulls.")},
{TEXT("Mark IV Female 以机枪压制步兵，整备快于雄型。没有主炮，无法损伤坦克车体。"),TEXT("Mark IV Female suppresses infantry with machine guns and prepares sooner than the male. Without cannon, it cannot damage tank hulls."),TEXT("低矮侧舱里的机枪沿壕沟交叉扫射。比雄型更快完成整备，适合伴随步兵压住枪位；没有主炮，无法击穿坦克。")},
{TEXT("Mark IV Female 以机枪压制步兵，整备快于雄型。没有主炮，无法损伤坦克车体。"),TEXT("Mark IV Female suppresses infantry with machine guns and prepares sooner than the male. Without cannon, it cannot damage tank hulls."),TEXT("Machine guns in shallow sponsons sweep the trenches. A shorter preparation than the male favours infantry support; without cannon it cannot penetrate tanks.")},
{TEXT("Captured Mark IV Female 以五挺机枪支援步兵，整备快于火炮型。遭遇敌方装甲时需要反坦克火力。"),TEXT("Captured Mark IV Female supports infantry with five machine guns and prepares sooner than cannon variants. Enemy armour requires anti-tank support.")},
{TEXT("Captured Mark IV Female 以五挺机枪支援步兵，整备快于火炮型。遭遇敌方装甲时需要反坦克火力。"),TEXT("Captured Mark IV Female supports infantry with five machine guns and prepares sooner than cannon variants. Enemy armour requires anti-tank support."),TEXT("修复车间让缴获的雌型车重回前线。五挺机枪构成移动火墙；维修整备快于火炮型，但必须依靠反坦克炮对付敌方装甲。")},
{TEXT("Captured Mark IV Female 以五挺机枪支援步兵，整备快于火炮型。遭遇敌方装甲时需要反坦克火力。"),TEXT("Captured Mark IV Female supports infantry with five machine guns and prepares sooner than cannon variants. Enemy armour requires anti-tank support."),TEXT("Repair workshops return a captured female tank to the front. Five machine guns cover the advance, with a shorter preparation than cannon tanks; enemy armour requires anti-tank support.")},
{TEXT("两侧六磅炮压住阵位，刘易斯机枪掩护步兵。履带受损后仍可留在原地射击。"),TEXT("Six-pounders in the sponsons strike enemy positions while Lewis guns cover the infantry. Even with damaged tracks, the tank can continue firing from its position.")},
{TEXT("Whippet 快速坦克"),TEXT("Whippet medium tank")},
{TEXT("固定战斗室内的 Hotchkiss 机枪追击步兵。机动较快，但没有火炮，无法与重装甲正面对射。"),TEXT("Hotchkiss guns in a fixed fighting compartment pursue infantry. It moves quickly but carries no cannon and cannot trade direct fire with heavy armour.")},
{TEXT("A7V 突击战车"),TEXT("A7V assault tank")},
{TEXT("车首五十七毫米炮与周围机枪守住火线。高大的车身需要步兵照应，履带和枪位可被分别击毁。"),TEXT("A forward 57 mm gun and surrounding machine guns command the field. The tall vehicle needs infantry protection. Tracks and gun positions can be knocked out separately.")},
{TEXT("缴获 Mark IV"),TEXT("Captured Mark IV")},
{TEXT("修复后披上德军识别标记的英国战车。保留侧炮台与菱形履带，依靠步兵守住身侧。"),TEXT("A repaired British tank bearing German recognition markings. It retains its sponsons and rhomboid tracks, relying on infantry to protect its sides.")},
{TEXT("编制不可用"),TEXT("This formation is unavailable")},
{TEXT("战斗已经结束，车组原地待命"),TEXT("The battle is over. The crew is waiting in position")},
{TEXT("亚眠行动时配属"),TEXT("Attached for the Amiens operation")},
{TEXT("康布雷行动时配属"),TEXT("Attached for the Cambrai operation")},
{TEXT("春季攻势时配属"),TEXT("Attached for the spring offensive")},
{TEXT("出发后呼叫装甲支援"),TEXT("Call armour after the operation begins")},
{TEXT("暂停中，请先继续"),TEXT("The battle is paused. Resume to continue")},
{TEXT("本段已有四辆战车，腾出位置后可继续部署。"),TEXT("Four tanks are already in this sector. Deploy more when space becomes available.")},
{TEXT("本段已有四辆战车，腾出位置后可继续部署。"),TEXT("Four tanks are already in this sector. Deploy more when space becomes available."),TEXT("本段已有四辆战车，等待前队撤出通路")},
{TEXT("本段已有四辆战车，腾出位置后可继续部署。"),TEXT("Four tanks are already in this sector. Deploy more when space becomes available."),TEXT("Four tanks are already in this sector. Wait for the route to clear")},
{TEXT("车组正在整备"),TEXT("The crew is preparing")},
{TEXT("装甲预备队正在整备"),TEXT("Armoured reserve forming up")},
{TEXT("战车尚未完成检修"),TEXT("The tank has not completed its inspection")},
{TEXT("%s 正沿后方通路进入"),TEXT("%s is entering along the rear approach")},
{TEXT("战车被击毁，步兵寻找掩护"),TEXT("A tank has been destroyed. Infantry are seeking cover")},
