{TEXT("在部队与敌方枪位之间铺设烟幕，掩护越过开阔地、转移战壕或遮住敌方反坦克炮观察员。浓烟同时遮蔽双方视线，炮弹仍能穿过。"),TEXT("Lay smoke between your men and an enemy gun. Use the screen to cross open ground, change trenches, or deny observers a clear shot at your armour. Both armies lose sight through it; shells still pass through.")},
{TEXT("进入毒气前先研习并配发防毒面具；烟幕不能隔绝毒气。"),TEXT("Research respirators before entering gas; a smoke screen provides no protection from gas.")},
{TEXT("目标不在视线内"),TEXT("Target out of sight")},
{TEXT("目标不在视线内"),TEXT("Target out of sight"),TEXT("已脱离视线")},
{TEXT("目标不在视线内"),TEXT("Target out of sight"),TEXT("No line of sight")},
{TEXT("士气已被击垮。"),TEXT("Morale has broken.")},
{TEXT("烟幕遮蔽双方视线，炮弹仍可穿过。"),TEXT("Smoke obscures both armies; shells can still pass through.")},
{TEXT("烟幕遮蔽双方视线，炮弹仍可穿过。"),TEXT("Smoke obscures both armies; shells can still pass through."),TEXT("两军都失去了掩护，烟幕不能抵挡炮弹。")},
{TEXT("烟幕遮蔽双方视线，炮弹仍可穿过。"),TEXT("Smoke obscures both armies; shells can still pass through."),TEXT("Smoke obscures both armies; it does not stop shells.")},
{TEXT("主攻已经越过前沿，接替部队必须打通观察壕与后方的通路。新配属的投弹队借烟幕清除壕口，步枪班逐段跟进；击溃阻截的守军，让补给纵队通过。"),TEXT("The main attack has passed the front line. Relieving troops must reopen the route between the observation trench and the rear. Bombers clear the trench mouths under smoke; rifle sections follow bay by bay. Break the blocking force and bring the supply column through.")},
{TEXT("夺回中央交通壕，打通后撤部队的退路。提防穿过烟雾的自动武器突击组；保护观察员，以机枪掩护反击，击溃切断交通线的追兵。"),TEXT("Retake the central communication trench and reopen the withdrawal route. Watch for assault groups advancing through the smoke. Protect the observers, cover the counterstroke with machine guns, and break the pursuit blocking the road.")},
{TEXT("前线来电"),TEXT("DISPATCHES FROM THE FRONT")},
{TEXT("出战序列"),TEXT("ORDERS OF BATTLE")},
{TEXT("%d 秒"),TEXT("%d seconds")},
