{TEXT("防毒面具操练从气密检查开始，滤罐必须远离泥水。完成研习后，部队获配面罩与滤罐，警报响起时便可佩戴，减少毒气造成的损失。"),TEXT("Respirator instruction begins with an airtight seal and a filter kept clear of muddy water. Once trained and equipped, the men can don their masks at the alarm and reduce losses to gas.")},
{TEXT("小盒式呼吸器需要专门操练。口具与鼻夹必须用对，软管与滤盒也要检查，弄湿的滤材必须更换；在警报响起之前，先安排装备配发与训练。"),TEXT("The small-box respirator demands practice. Fit the mouthpiece and nose clip correctly; inspect the hose and filter box, and replace wet filter material. Arrange this equipment and training before the alarm sounds.")},
