{TEXT("我军士气"),TEXT("Our morale")},
{TEXT("敌军士气"),TEXT("Enemy morale")},
{TEXT("友军误伤、毒气和近距离装甲威胁会动摇士气。攻下战壕、稳步推进，以及互相支援的部队会少量恢复信心。"),TEXT("Friendly shellfire, gas and nearby enemy armour sap morale. Taking trenches, advancing and keeping sections in mutual support restore a little confidence.")},
{TEXT("夺取中央与敌军纵深两道战壕，或迫使敌军撤退"),TEXT("Capture the centre and both enemy trench lines, or force the enemy to retreat.")},
{TEXT("中央阵地与敌军纵深防线已被我军夺取。"),TEXT("Our troops have secured the centre and both enemy trench lines.")},
{TEXT("敌军夺取了中央阵地与我军纵深防线。"),TEXT("The enemy has secured the centre and both of our trench lines.")},
{TEXT("装甲突破了最后一道防线。"),TEXT("Armour has broken through the final defensive line.")},
{TEXT("夺取中央及敌方纵深两道战壕，或突破远端防线；迫使敌军士气崩溃也能取胜。友军误伤、毒气和装甲威胁动摇士气；攻克阵地、推进与互相支援会恢复少量信心。"),TEXT("Secure the centre and both enemy trench lines, break through the far boundary, or force a retreat. Friendly shellfire, gas and armour threaten morale. Capturing ground, advancing and mutual support restore confidence.")},
{TEXT("越过最后一道敌壕后，继续突破敌军后方交通线；占壕本身不会结束战斗。迫使敌军士气崩溃也能取胜。友军误伤、毒气和装甲威胁动摇士气；攻克阵地、推进与互相支援会恢复少量信心。"),TEXT("After the last enemy trench, push through the rear communications line; trench occupation alone does not end the battle. Breaking enemy morale also wins. Friendly shellfire, gas and armour shake morale; captured ground, an advance and mutual support restore some confidence.")},
{TEXT("友军炮火"),TEXT("Friendly shellfire")},
{TEXT("毒气暴露"),TEXT("Gas exposure")},
{TEXT("直面敌军装甲"),TEXT("Facing enemy armour")},
{TEXT("战壕失守"),TEXT("Trench lost")},
{TEXT("攻克敌壕"),TEXT("Enemy trench captured")},
{TEXT("向前推进"),TEXT("Forward progress")},
{TEXT("互相支援"),TEXT("Mutual support")},
{TEXT("两道战壕"),TEXT("Both trench lines")},
{TEXT("纵深防线"),TEXT("Defensive line in depth")},
