{TEXT("进攻间隔较长，有时间整队和等待增援。"),TEXT("Longer attack intervals allow time to regroup and await reinforcements."),TEXT("There is still time to wait for reinforcements.")},
{TEXT("敌军进攻间隔更短，会保留预备队，并对已发现的暴露枪位呼叫炮火。及时转移和增援，避免枪组孤立。"),TEXT("The enemy attacks at shorter intervals, keeps reserves and calls artillery on observed, exposed gun posts. Move and reinforce promptly to keep gun crews supported.")},
{TEXT("敌军进攻间隔更短，会保留预备队，并对已发现的暴露枪位呼叫炮火。及时转移和增援，避免枪组孤立。"),TEXT("The enemy attacks at shorter intervals, keeps reserves and calls artillery on observed, exposed gun posts. Move and reinforce promptly to keep gun crews supported."),TEXT("敌军保留预备队，寻找暴露的火力点。炮火与突击接踵而至。")},
{TEXT("敌军进攻间隔更短，会保留预备队，并对已发现的暴露枪位呼叫炮火。及时转移和增援，避免枪组孤立。"),TEXT("The enemy attacks at shorter intervals, keeps reserves and calls artillery on observed, exposed gun posts. Move and reinforce promptly to keep gun crews supported."),TEXT("The enemy holds reserves and seeks exposed gun positions. Bombardment and assault follow close behind.")},
